        "bridge_phrase": null,
        "institutional_terms_found": [],
        "register_shift": true,
        "seam_flag": false,
        "seam_note": null
      }
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "words": 43,
      "text": "[The] third rock is the great thought, which was summoned from Jesus, the glorious one. He set it in the holy church. The church gathered in upon it, and has lived in [it]. It has stood firm, with a true fixity, for ever.",
